    "body": "I have the same issue with the following config\r\n\r\n```toml\r\n\"$schema\" = 'https://starship.rs/config-schema.json'\r\n\r\n[username]\r\nformat = '[$user]($style) | '\r\nshow_always = true\r\n\r\n[hostname]\r\nformat = '[$hostname$ssh_symbol]($style) | '\r\nssh_only = false\r\n\r\n[directory]\r\ntruncation_length = 4\r\ntruncate_to_repo = false\r\nbefore_repo_root_style = 'dimmed purple'\r\nrepo_root_style = 'bold cyan'\r\n\r\n[git_branch]\r\nformat = ' [$symbol$branch(:$remote_branch)]($style) '\r\n\r\n[golang]\r\ndisabled = true\r\n\r\n[rust]\r\ndisabled = true\r\n\r\n[status]\r\ndisabled = false\r\n```\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/starship/starship/assets/24536673/37a9c0e1-50d6-4c5f-a839-e8f6f3b354f7)\r\n\r\nI thought it might help narrow things down with a repro from a simpler config.",
